{"symbol":"PRINCEPIPE","yahoo":"PRINCEPIPE.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE689W01016","name":"Prince Pipes and Fittings Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.princepipes.com","about":"Prince Pipes and Fittings Limited manufactures and sells piping solutions in India. The company offers the SMARTFIT PLUS chlorinated polyvinyl chloride (CPVC) hot and cold potable water plumbing systems, EASYFIT unplasticized polyvinyl chloride (UPVC) plumbing systems, and EASYFIT RE reclaim piping systems; Onefit Corzan CPVC industrial piping system, GREENFIT poly propylene random copolymer (PPR) plumbing and industrial piping systems, GREENFIT BLUE PPR industrial piping systems; and Skolan Safe polypropylene (PP) drainage system. It also provides HT Safe low-noise PP drainage system, SILENTFIT low-noise SWR systems with seals, RAINFIT roof water systems, and BIOFIT septic tanks; AQUAFIT agriculture pressure pipes and fittings, SAFEFIT borewell systems, and PEfit Aqua high-density polyethylene pipes; FOAMFIT underground drainage piping systems, DRAINFIT UPVC underground drainage piping systems, DRAINFIT inspection chambers, CORFIT underground double-wall corrugated pipes, CORFIT inspection chambers, and DURAFIT fiber-reinforced plastic manhole and chamber covers; and STOREFIT water tanks. In addition, the company provides WIREFIT electrical conduit pipes and fittings and CABLEFIT cable ducting pipes; Hauraton surface drainage system; and Duratap polytetra methylene terepthalate tapware. Further, it offers bathware-faucets and showers, as well as sanitaryware. Prince Pipes and Fittings Limited was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:29:22+00:00","quote":{"price":261.8,"prevClose":259.8,"marketCap":2895.04,"high52":352.2,"low52":205.0,"pe":27.85,"bookValue":148.61,"dividendRate":1.0,"roe":null,"shares":11.0561,"insiders":60.63,"institutions":20.41},"prices":{"dates":["2019-12-30","201